```grf:context id="release"
{
  "format": "grf.public-document/v1",
  "title": "RELEASE",
  "content": "Version 0.6.0 candidate\n\nAdds Linux subreaper cleanup for session-escaped descendants and optional children: deny checks/actions on Windows and supported Linux. See PROCESS.grf for enforcement and limitations.\n\nAdds open self-service HTTPS enrollment, per-project credentials, automatic exact-action registration within each user's namespace, and renewal during active use. The init --cloud option creates and enrolls a project in one command. Existing mTLS/Relay access remains supported.\n\nThe public service performs authenticated cooperative admission. It does not independently verify customer-local checks or judge arbitrary command safety. See README.grf for account capacity, expiry and availability limits.\n\nArtifacts: grf-client-0.6.0.zip and grf-client-0.6.0.zip.sha256. Verify publisher and checksum separately, then run verify_release.py. Existing 0.4.1 and 0.6.0 artifacts remain unchanged. No 0.6.0 release is published by this branch.\n"
}
```
